# wear/woman/wrap: the woman's wrap (STYLE_P2 22 "Wrap"; the southern and island peoples): a long cloth1 garment wound about her,
# its end (the drape, in accent) thrown over her left shoulder: the right shoulder and arm bare, the drape crossing her front from
# the left shoulder to under the right arm and falling down her back; the skirt (the hang) to the ankles, the wound edge running
# across it as one fold, the drape's end down the back
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment wrap
layer torso
anchor neck
keys torso

